# W31g, b (k10): joins a in stag0201, goes on to stag0202 (matz00); sees one notice for a's entries and closes the
# offer with B.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@100
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
log b in stag0201
idle until frames>=300
explore matz00 yes until stage=stag0202,control fail epoch>=@500
log b in stag0202
idle until notices>=1 fail epoch>=@900
log b sees the notice
closeoffer until frames>=60
log b closed the offer
idle until frames>=3600 fail notices>=1
log b saw no further notice
